me va! Détruisons le monde,{SAUT}et après on...! Hein? Non?(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0597", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": " Why ya gotta put it that way...?"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "Th-That's cold!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": " Pourquoi tu dis ça comme ça...?"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "C-C'est froid!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": " Why ya gotta put it that way...?{SAUT}Th-That's cold!(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": " Pourquoi tu dis ça comme ça...?{SAUT}C-C'est froid!(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0598", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "   Why ya gotta be all cold!? You don't"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "get demons at all!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "   Pourquoi t'es si froid!? Tu comprends"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "rien aux démons!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "   Why ya gotta be all cold!? You don't{SAUT}get demons at all!(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "   Pourquoi t'es si froid!? Tu comprends{SAUT}rien aux démons!(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0599", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "What, are you worried about me? Damn,"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "man... I'm touched..."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "Quoi, tu t'inquiètes pour moi? Merde,"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "mec... ça me touche..."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "What, are you worried about me? Damn,{SAUT}man... I'm touched...(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "Quoi, tu t'inquiètes pour moi? Merde,{SAUT}mec... ça me touche...(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0600", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "I-I knew it! You're gonna shut me up!"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "I'll be killed or locked away forever!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "J-Je le savais! Tu vas me faire taire!"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "Je serai tué ou enfermé à jamais!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "I-I knew it! You're gonna shut me up!{SAUT}I'll be killed or locked away forever!(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "J-Je le savais! Tu vas me faire taire!{SAUT}Je serai tué ou enfermé à jamais!(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0601", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "   That was a joke? C'mon, "}, {"j": "[FFF3]"}, {"t": ","}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "if ya don't laugh, they'll kill ya..."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "   C'était une blague? Allez, "}, {"j": "[FFF3]"}, {"t": ","}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "si tu ris pas, ils te tuent..."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "   That was a joke? C'mon, [FFF3],{SAUT}if ya don't laugh, they'll kill ya...(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "   C'était une blague? Allez, [FFF3],{SAUT}si tu ris pas, ils te tuent...(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0602", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "   Hyahaha! Good one! But I ain't gonna"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "be fooled!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "   Hyahaha! Bien joué! Mais on me la"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "fait pas!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "   Hyahaha! Good one! But I ain't gonna{SAUT}be fooled!(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "   Hyahaha! Bien joué! Mais on me la{SAUT}fait pas!(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0603", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "Ha, brings back memories. I was kinda"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "like that once... Maybe I should relive"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "those days!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "Ha, ça me rappelle des souvenirs."}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "J'étais un peu comme ça, avant..."}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "Je devrais revivre ce temps-là!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "Ha, brings back memories. I was kinda{SAUT}like that once... Maybe I should relive{SAUT}those days!(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "Ha, ça me rappelle des souvenirs.{SAUT}J'étais un peu comme ça, avant...{SAUT}Je devrais revivre ce temps-là!(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0604", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "  So it's something you've gotta do, even"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "if you don't believe in it. Hm. I see..."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "  Donc c'est un truc à faire même si"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "t'y crois pas. Hm. Je vois..."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "  So it's something you've gotta do, even{SAUT}if you don't believe in it. Hm. I see...(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "  Donc c'est un truc à faire même si{SAUT}t'y crois pas. Hm. Je vois...(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0605", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "   You don't know? How am I supposed to let"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "a fool like you control me!?"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "   Tu sais pas? Comment je pourrais"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {"t": "laisser un sot comme toi me commander!?"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "   You don't know? How am I supposed to let{SAUT}a fool like you control me!?(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "   Tu sais pas? Comment je pourrais{SAUT}laisser un sot comme toi me commander!?(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:text:0606", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:text", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "  Arrgggh! Wh-What are you doing!? You're"}, {"nl": "{SAUT}"}, {