 temps... C'est compliqué..."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "   Hmmm... I'm kinda happy, but sad at{SAUT}the same time... It's complicated...(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "   Hmmm... J'suis content et triste{SAUT}en même temps... C'est compliqué...(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp:0001", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp", "occ": 1, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "No, I'm not."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}, {"t": "   "}], "fr": [{"t": "Non, pas moi."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "No, I'm not.(*RESPONSE*)   ", "brut_fr": "Non, pas moi.(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp:0002", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp", "occ": 10, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "I'm not lying!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}, {"t": " "}], "fr": [{"t": "Je mens pas!"}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "I'm not lying!(*RESPONSE*) ", "brut_fr": "Je mens pas!(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp:0003", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp", "occ": 4, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "I lied."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "Menti."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "I lied.(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "Menti.(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp:0006", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp", "occ": 4, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "I'm not confident..."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}, {"t": "   "}], "fr": [{"t": "Je suis pas sûr..."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "I'm not confident...(*RESPONSE*)   ", "brut_fr": "Je suis pas sûr...(*RESPONSE*)", "japonais": false, "technique": false}, {"id": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp:0008", "bloc": "KYOUKI.BIN:resp", "occ": 6, "loc": "", "loc_en": "", "portrait": "", "en": [{"t": "I think so."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "fr": [{"t": "Je crois."}, {"nl": "(*RESPONSE*)"}], "brut_en": "I think so.(*RESPONSE*)", "brut_fr": "Je crois.(*RESPONSE*